``` USB Mass Storage Inserted
    Purpose : Report removable storage devices connected to endpoints so they
              can be checked against the removable media policy.
    Data    : Windows Security log, EventCode 6416 (new external device
              recognized). Requires the "Audit PNP Activity" policy.
    Controls: MP-7, SC-41, SI-4
    Tuning  : Allowlist approved, encrypted device IDs with a lookup.
    Example environment: Harborlight Logistics (fictional). ```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=6416
| where match(ClassName, "(?i)(DiskDrive|USB|WPD)")
| stats count AS insertions min(_time) AS first_seen values(DeviceDescription) AS devices values(DeviceId) AS device_ids BY ComputerName, SubjectUserName
| convert ctime(first_seen)
| sort - insertions
